{
  "uid": "qe-business",
  "title": "quick-ecommerce — Business KPIs",
  "tags": ["quick-ecommerce", "phase-3", "business"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Orders placed (range)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(orders_placed_total[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Orders confirmed (range)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(orders_finalized_total{status=\"confirmed\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Realized GMV (range, ₹)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyINR", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(gmv_rupees_total[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Signups (range)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(signups_total[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Order funnel — placed vs finalized by status (per min)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "sum"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(orders_placed_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "placed"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(orders_finalized_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "finalized — {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Payment attempts by provider & outcome (per min)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "sum"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (provider, status) (rate(payment_attempts_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} — {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Checkout saga latency p50 / p95 / p99 (placement → confirmation)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 5 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(order_saga_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(order_saga_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(order_saga_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Deferred meters (not yet instrumented)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These Pillar-3 KPIs from the plan are **deferred** — the data model has no signal for them yet, so they are intentionally absent rather than faked:\n\n- **cart_abandonment** — cart-service emits no abandonment event (no checkout-started vs completed pairing).\n- **on_time_delivery_ratio** — the Order model has no SLA/promised-delivery deadline field to compare against; only a manual `DELIVERED` flip exists.\n- **active_users** (rolling 10m gauge) — no session store / online-presence source to derive it from.\n\nWiring any of these needs a new domain signal first — tracked for a later increment."
      }
    }
  ]
}
